**************** Key Point : *****************************
We should not block the Public Access ( Uncheck that when you are creating the Bucket ) -- 
Properties Tab -- Static website --> Enable --> provide our both file names .. 

Once the Code is uploaded then we can update the policy 

*** Permission --> Bucket Policy ***

{
    "Version": "2012-10-17",
    "Statement": [
        {
            "Sid": "PublicReadGetObject",
            "Effect": "Allow",
            "Principal": "*",
            "Action": "s3:GetObject",
            "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::my-loveaws2-website-bucket/*"
        }
    ]
}

